        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Carbon Cycle Geochemistry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                    CARBON CYCLE ARCHITECTURE                     |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                  |\n|  SHORT CYCLE (yr-kyr)          LONG CYCLE (Myr-Gyr)              |\n|  --------------------          ---------------------------        |\n|  Atmosphere CO₂ (~800 Gt C)   Carbonate weathering              |\n|  Land biosphere (~600 Gt C)   Silicate weathering               |\n|  Soil (~1600 Gt C)            Volcanic outgassing               |\n|  Ocean surface (~1000 Gt C)   Organic C burial                  |\n|  Deep ocean (~38,000 Gt C)    Carbonate burial                  |\n|  Marine sediments              Subduction recycling              |\n|                                                                  |\n|  KEY FLUXES (Gt C/yr):                                           |\n|  GPP:         ~120 (photosynthesis, land)                       |\n|  Respiration: ~119 (land ecosystem)                             |\n|  Ocean-atm:   ~90 ± 2 (net: -2.5 Gt C/yr to ocean)             |\n|  Weathering:  ~0.3 (silicate; long-cycle)                       |\n|  Volcanism:   ~0.3 (outgassing; long-cycle)                     |\n|  Human:       ~10 Gt C/yr (fossil fuels; short-cycle timescale) |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
