      "text": "RESERVOIR              δ¹³C (‰ vs V-PDB)    EXPLANATION\n  ---------              -----------------    -----------\n  Mantle / volcanic CO₂  -5 to -7‰           Magmatic carbon\n  Marine carbonates      0 to +5‰             Inorganic precipitation; near mantle\n  Marine organic carbon  -20 to -25‰          Marine photosynthesis (C3 pathway)\n  C3 land plants         -24 to -30‰          Calvin cycle; partial ¹³C discrim.\n  C4 land plants         -10 to -14‰          Hatch-Slack pathway; less discrim.\n  Marine DIC (dissolved) +0.5 to +2.5‰        Modern ocean surface\n  Deep ocean DIC         -0.5 to +1.5‰        Remineralization removes ¹²C\n  Freshwater DIC         -12 to +2‰           Soil CO₂ (respiration) influence\n  Soil CO₂               -20 to -25‰          Plant decomposition\n  Methane (biogenic)     -50 to -80‰          Methanogenesis (extreme depletion)\n  Methane (thermogenic)  -25 to -50‰          Thermal breakdown of organic matter\n  Coal                   -23 to -26‰          Land plant kerogen\n  Marine shale TOC       -25 to -32‰          Marine organic matter burial\n  Petroleum              -25 to -32‰          Marine origin"
